id: date/round-trip/0079
area: date
op: Date.parse of toUTCString
in: f64:0x42ECCEFA43FB8000
out: value: f64:0x42ECCEFA43FB8000
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: Date.parse reads back none of this engine's own toUTCString renderings for a year below 1 or above 9999 and answers NaN, where it must answer the time value rendered (21.4.3.2): the .NET formats it parses with cannot hold the year. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-6.5 (the Date area's record; the correspondence's row P9).
